        'onam', 'Onam Harvest Festival', 8, 'Chingam Month (Aug–Sep)', 'September 5, 2026', 'Thiruvonam Asterism', 'Kerala', 'kerala', 'harvest', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600093463592-8e36ae95ef56?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80', 'Kerala’s harvest festival commemorating King Mahabali with floral carpets, boat races, and Onasadya feasts.', 'Celebrates abundance, equality, communal harmony, and cultural pride through elaborate folk art forms.'
